        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The batter for this cake is very liquid -- more liquid than most cake batters. This is correct. The hot water (or coffee) in the batter blooms the cocoa and makes the chocolate flavour deeper. Do not worry about the consistency when it goes in the tin."
          }
        ]
      },
